n<div class=\"a1mzdm1v\" id=\"div-gpt-ad-cnyes_news_article_middle_1\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 32px auto; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 0; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; width: 728px; height: 90px; max-width: 728px; max-height: 90px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.5px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; --a1mzdm1v-0: 728px; --a1mzdm1v-1: 90px; --a1mzdm1v-2: 728px; --a1mzdm1v-3: 90px; --a1mzdm1v-4: 32px; --a1mzdm1v-5: 32px; --a1mzdm1v-6: auto; --a1mzdm1v-7: auto;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p _msthash=\"239\" _msttexthash=\"922485096\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">美元周二在狭幅区间内整理，先前公布的12月零售销售持平。 接下来，市场将在周三迎来1月非农就业数据，并于周五公布消费者物价指数（CPI）。</span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p _msthash=\"240\" _msttexthash=\"1355797508\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">上述数据将被用来判读利率前景。 美国总统特朗普提名华许（Kevin Warsh）接任联准会（Fed）主席、取代鲍尔（Jerome Powell），市场对美国货币政策路径的看法已转趋不确定。</span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p _msthash=\"241\" _msttexthash=\"231560628\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">起初市场认为华许相较其他人选「不那么鸽派」，一度引发美元急弹。</span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhengh