的</strong>订单执行不仅能帮助交易者抓住最佳交易时机，还能提高交易效率，无论您身在何处，都能享受与机构交易员同等的流畅体验。此外XM开发了全平台交易解决方案，用户可以通过桌面端、网页端和移动端（Ios和 Android）随时随地进行交易。<br><strong>“双无承诺 ”告别滑点与拒单</strong><br>XM自主研发交易引擎，以毫秒级响应速度处理订单，<strong>无重复报价（</strong><strong>No Requotes</strong><strong>）、无订单拒绝（</strong><strong>No. Rejections</strong><strong>）</strong>无论是突发行情还是高频交易，您的每一笔订单都能精准完成，彻底告别“想买买不到，想卖卖不出的遗憾 ”，独创的“离线订单 ”更是行业的领先 ，即使在网络不稳定或断网的情况下，用户仍可以预设交易指令，系统将在网络恢复后自动执行 ，有效避免错失市场机会 。<br><strong>高杠杆灵活适配 &nbsp;</strong><br>根据品种差异限制和监管与地区差异要求，XM提供（1：1、1000：1）的杠杆选择，（主流地区是1000:1，欧盟地区是30:1）助您在控制风险的同时放大收益潜力。<br><strong>三、交易工具</strong><br><strong>X</strong><strong>M</strong><strong>平台支持 </strong><strong>MetaTrader4(MT4)</strong><strong>和</strong><strong>MetaTrader5(MT5)</strong><strong>这两款全球最受欢迎的交易软件</strong>。MT4以其强大的图标分析功能和自动化交易能力而闻名。而MT5则在MT4的基础上增加了更多高级功能，支持股票、期货等更多金融产品的交易 ，满足了专业交易者的多样化的需求。<br><strong>四、 产品与服务：满足全球交易者的多样化的需求</strong><br>XM平台提供的交易产品种类丰富，覆盖了全球主要金融市场，满足了不同风险偏好和投资策略的金融需求。<br><strong>五、交易产品种类及客户支持政策</strong><br>在外汇交易方面 ，XM提供超过55种货币对，包括主要货币对，次要货币对和exotic&nbsp;货币对。主要货币对如EUR/USD、GBP/USD等的点差极具竞争力，最低可达0.6点，为高频交易者提供了成本优势。&nbsp;除此XM还提供多种大宗商品的交易，包括黄金、白银等贵金属，以及原油、天然气等能源产品。XM不止于外汇 ，对于股票市场感兴趣的交易者， XM提供超过1000种股票&nbsp;CFD (差价合约)&nbsp;，涵盖了全球主要证券交易所的知名公司股票，此外，XM还提供股指、加密货币等多种交易产品，真正实现了“一个平台，多种市场“的一站式交易体验，客户支持是XM的另一大亮点，平台提供24/5的多语言客户支持，用户可以通过电话、邮件或在线聊天等多种方式获取帮助。平台支持30多种语言，真正实现了全球化服务。无论你来自哪个国家，使用哪种语言 ，都能在平台上获得流畅的交易。<br><strong>六、平台体验：简单操作高效交易</strong><br>XM为客户提供全终端覆盖的交易工具,无论电脑还是手机,随时随地地掌握市场。<br><strong>M</strong><strong>T4/MT5: </strong>行业公认的专业的交易平台,支持自动化交易（EA）、自定义指标、多图标分析；<br><strong>XM Mobile App : </strong>ios / And roid 双系统，实时行情、闪电下单、账户管理一手掌握。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><strong>七、教育资源：从新手到高手的成长之路 </strong><br><strong>免费课程：</strong>为了帮助交易者提升技能，XM还提供了丰富的教育资源。包括视频教程、网络研讨会、市场分析报告等。这些资源覆盖了从基础知识到高级交易者策略的各个方面，适合不同水平的交易者学习和参考。<br><strong>直播讲座：</strong>定期邀请行业专家分享经验和见解，还定期举办线上线下的交易研讨会，这种互动式的学习方式不仅能帮助交易者提升技能，还能促进交易者之间的交流和分享。<br><strong>八、技术创新引领未来：全球认可值得信赖</strong><br><strong>客户规模：</strong>经过15的发展，XM已经建立起强大的全球影响力，平台目前在190多个拥有超过1500万用户，月交易超过3000亿美元。<br><strong>重大升级：</strong>2025年将平台的技术水平推向新的高度，AL助手和TradingView整合等功能的引入，不仅提供了交易效率，也为普通人提供了专业级的分析工具。<br><strong>行业荣誉：</strong>多次获得 “最佳<a href=\"https://www.chiefrich.com/dealer/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"infotextkey\">外汇经纪商</a> “最佳客户服务 ” 等奖项。<br>携手XM-不仅是交易平台，更是您财富增长的伙伴 。对于那些渴望在金融市场中获得成就的人来说，选择一个像XM这样的平台，是你叩响财富成功之门的第一步<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;',0,9,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17272.html','2026-02-09 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:56:51'),(1370,22,NULL,'连续两年亏损，Capital Index UK更名Vantos Markets',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'根据英国公司注册处（Companies House）近日公布的官方文件，受英国金融行为监管局（FCA）监管的差价合约（CFD）经纪商 Capital Index UK Limited，已正式完成法律名称变更，新注册名称为 Van...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041071748_zohc9v.png','<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">根据英国公司注册处（Companies House）近日公布的官方文件，受英国金融行为监管局（FCA）监管的差价合约（CFD）经纪商 Capital Index UK Limited，已正式完成法律名称变更，新注册名称为 Vantos Markets UK Limited。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">此次更名行动，正值该经纪商面临连续多年的经营挑战。财务数据显示，尽管公司在2024财年实现了税前利润23,678英镑（上年同期为税前亏损207,006英镑），但由于税务等因素，税后净亏损仍达18,247英镑，这已是其连续第二年未能实现税后盈利。公司营业额同比下滑超过17%，管理层在报告中指出，生活成本压力及英国市场客户交易活动减弱是主要影响因素。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">文件显示，名称变更已于近日完成法律注册程序，公司股东已通过了相关特别决议。需要指出的是，此次仅为法律名称变更，该公司在英格兰和威尔士的注册性质、公司编号及法律结构均未发生改变。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">更名未涉及业务与监管调整</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">目前，公司尚未公开说明此次品牌重塑的具体原因。根据公开文件，此次更名不涉及公司所有权结构、英国FCA监管许可或现有业务范围的任何变更。该公司将继续作为受监管的差价合约提供商，为客户提供多资产杠杆交易服务。</p>',0,7,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17249.html','2026-02-07 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:56:08'),(1371,22,NULL,'CWG Markets又爆新瓜：被指“卡金拒付”，用户出金遭冻结',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'近日，有投资者在网络发帖控诉交易平台CWG Markets无故限制账户并拒绝出金。...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041072076_99mt9i.png','<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">近日，有投资者在网络发帖控诉交易平台CWG Markets无故限制账户并拒绝出金。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: italic; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 18px;\">CWG Markets再陷出金争议：风控还是“卡款”？</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; text-indent: 2em;\">根据用户曝光的邮件内容看，CWG Markets指控其多个交易账户涉嫌“利用高频延迟套利和多账户对冲策略非法掠夺流动性池”。平台称已暂停账户功能并转入人工审查，承诺在3个工作日内给出结论：若确认违规将按政策处理；若未违规则恢复功能。</span></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"CWG Markets又爆新瓜：被指“卡金拒付”，用户出金遭冻结\" data-height=\"1030px\" data-viewer=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2026/01/28/183824115.jpg\" data-width=\"1555px\" height=\"397\" src=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2026/01/28/183824115.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer; text-align: center; max-width: 95%;\" title=\"\" width=\"600\"></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">查阅该平台交易限制条款发现，其第17条明确规定，单日超过75手或超过总交易量20%的仓位，单笔持仓短于120秒且超过一定手数或比例的交易，将被视为“受限交易”；同时严禁包括“延迟套利”在内的任何套利行为，包括“延迟套利”和“赠金套利”，并声明由此产生的违规利润可能被判无效。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"CWG Markets又爆新瓜：被指“卡金拒付”，用户出金遭冻结\" data-height=\"379px\" data-viewer=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2026/01/28/183845646.jpg\" data-width=\"789px\" height=\"288\" src=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2026/01/28/183845646.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer; text-align: center; max-width: 95%;\" title=\"\" width=\"600\"></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">由于用户未公开具体订单细节，目前难以判断其是否确实违反平台规则。这也使事件陷入争议：用户是否违规及平台行为属于“恶意卡款”或“正当风控”尚无定论。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; text-indent: 2em;\">更值得警惕的是，在调查尚未结束前，平台即冻结账户资金，且未给出明确处理期限。</span></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; text-indent: 2em;\">据调查，CWG Markets虽宣称持有英国FCA以及瓦努阿图VFSC牌照，但后者属离岸监管，投资者维权难度较高。截至目前，平台尚未公布最终调查结论。</span></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: italic; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 18px;\">致富财经网提醒</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; text-indent: 2em;\">这起事件再次暴露出部分平台规则模糊、解释权高度集中等问题。对交易者而言，</span><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; text-indent: 2em;\">理解规则与合规交易显得尤为重要。</span></p>',0,7,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17248.html','2026-02-07 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:56:19'),(1372,22,NULL,'EC Markets 与利物浦足球俱乐部推出 “Hold or Trade”，开启探索心态与决策的新方式',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'将足球决策与交易心态连接起来...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041072406_n8xorf.jpg','<figure class=\"wp-block-image  is-resized\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px 0px 1em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-27051\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"535\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" src=\"https://www.ecmarkets.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/960x535-3-1.webp\" srcset=\"https://www.ecmarkets.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/960x535-3-1.webp 960w, https://www.ecmarkets.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/960x535-3-1-300x167.webp 300w, https://www.ecmarkets.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/960x535-3-1-768x428.webp 768w\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; width: 1344px;\" width=\"960\"></figure>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">EC Markets 已正式推出<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">“</strong><a href=\"https://www.chiefrich.com/ec/fcthxr\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; word-break: break-word;\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">Hold or Trade</strong></a><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">”</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>全新活动。本次活动由 EC Markets 与利物浦足球俱乐部（Liverpool FC）合作打造，将足球、人类行为与交易心态融合为一场互动体验。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">该活动的核心是一个简单却高风险的问题：</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; text-align: center; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">你会选择持有还是交易？</strong></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">这个选择成为整个故事系列的锚点：它把市场的逻辑带入足球世界，也把足球的情绪带入交易世界。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Hold or Trade 捕捉了日常生活中真实的决策瞬间：普通人在面对挑战时做出的选择。他们的反应——从犹豫到自信，再到凭直觉作出决定——映射出无论在球场上还是在市场中，做出果断行动所需的心态。</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: inherit; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">将足球决策与交易心态连接起来</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Hold or Trade 围绕那些定义运动员与交易者的关键时刻而打造：瞬间决策、压力下的直觉，以及全力投入的能力。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">通过贴近生活、以故事驱动的内容，本次活动帮助受众探索：</p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 24px; list-style: outside; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0.5rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important;\">运动员如何应对高压情境</li>\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0.5rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important;\">交易者如何评估机会与风险</li>\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0.5rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important;\">心态如何塑造每一个决策</li>\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0.5rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important;\">足球策略如何转化为更好的金融行为</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">目标很简单：<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">让交易心理学变得熟悉、有人情味、并且容易共鸣。</strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: inherit; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">围绕真实决策打造的内容系列</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Hold or Trade 以一系列短视频与互动数字内容拉开序幕，探索当决策真正重要时，人们会如何思考。该系列将娱乐性与实用的心态洞察结合，并以简单易懂的方式呈现。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">更多内容即将上线。在接下来的几周里，EC Markets 将发布独家 Hold or Trade 视频，邀请利物浦足球俱乐部的关键球员登场，让他们面对各自的决策情境，选择是否“持有或交易”传奇球员。</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: inherit; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">全球数字化推广启动</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">该活动于今日正式启动，并在包括<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">拉丁美洲</strong>、<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">亚太地区（APAC）</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>及其他全球市场的重点区域推出<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">高能量广告与数字内容</strong>。&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">推广的每一个阶段都将用户带向决策发生的关键瞬间，帮助他们理解心态如何把足球思维与交易行为联系在一起。</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: inherit; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">这就是 Hold or Trade</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Hold or Trade 不仅仅是一场创意合作。它是一种全新的决策思考方式，是一个让足球最伟大的理念与交易最聪明的原则相遇的空间。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">随着活动逐步展开，我们希望帮助用户发现：</p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 24px; list-style: outside; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0.5rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important;\">正确的心态可以改变选择</li>\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0.5rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important;\">自信可以被学习并通过练习培养</li>\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0.5rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important;\">足球思维映射交易行为</li>\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0.5rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important;\">微小瞬间也能揭示强大的启示</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">无论你选择持有还是交易，<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">每一个选择都在讲述一个故事。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 20px; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(65, 66, 70) !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.1px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">旅程，也从这里开始。</p>',0,11,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17245.html','2026-02-06 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:56:20'),(1373,22,NULL,'芝商所对 MPT 开出罚单，涉铜期货持仓超限',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'芝商所（CME Group）近日发布一则纪律处分公告，对Marex Professional Trading Services公司（简称MPT）采取处罚措施。根据公告，CME Group 商业行为委员会的一个小组认定，在2025年2月27...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041072727_l3xb1u.jpg','<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">芝商所（CME Group）近日发布一则纪律处分公告，对Marex Professional Trading Services公司（简称MPT）采取处罚措施。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">根据公告，CME Group 商业行为委员会的一个小组认定，在2025年2月27日收盘时，MPT持有的2025年3月铜金融期货合约头寸为892手，超出了交易所规定的800手持仓限额，超额幅度达11.50%（即92手）。MPT在次日（2月28日）交易中平仓了该超额头寸，使持仓恢复合规，并因此获利8,050美元。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">该小组判定，MPT的上述行为违反了交易所的第562号规则（持仓限额规则）。MPT通过提交和解协议了结此事，其在协议中既未承认也未否认相关违规指控。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">最终，根据和解条款，该小组责令MPT支付20,000美元罚款，并上缴其因本次违规交易所获的8,050美元利润。</p>',0,12,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17208.html','2026-02-03 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:56:13'),(1374,22,NULL,'XM 入金账户涉诈，六年老客户银行卡被冻结，交易爆仓',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'2025年12月29日晚9点，一位使用XM平台长达六年的汇友，像往常一样尝试向交易账户入金3000元人民币，收款方是XM平台提供的私人银行账户，结果提示转账失败。随后的遭遇远超他的预期：...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041073046_kltczt.jpg','<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">2025年12月29日晚9点，一位使用XM平台长达六年的汇友，像往常一样尝试向交易账户入金3000元人民币，收款方是XM平台提供的私人银行账户，结果提示转账失败。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">随后的遭遇远超他的预期：所有银行卡被冻结、无法补充保证金、最终在市场波动中爆仓。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">入金失败，账户涉诈遭冻结</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">据汇友描述，2025年12月29日晚9点左右，他向XM平台提供的私人银行账户进行入金操作，转账金额为3000元，结果提示转账失败。不久，他就收到了来自96110反诈预警专线的电话和短信。<strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">电话中，警方明确告知他转账的银行卡为“涉诈账户”。第二天中午，他的银行卡被警方冻结。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">更糟糕的情况接踵而至。1月5日，市场行情剧烈波动，由于银行卡被冻结无法补充保证金，汇友的交易账户在1月6日早晨爆仓，损失13000美元（合约人民币9万元）。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">汇友表示，他自2020年起使用XM平台，累计亏损已超20万元，经历过数次爆仓。他从未归咎于平台，认为那是自己交易决策的结果。但此次事件截然不同，这次损失本可以避免的！</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">汇友强调：“我明明可以补充保证金，不会爆仓的，但是由于XM平台提供涉诈卡，导致本人银行卡被冻结无法补充资金，最终才爆仓。”</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">平台拒不认账、冷漠回应</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">事发后，汇友第一时间联系了XM平台。平台客服的回复让他更加心寒：对方不承认其收款账户存在问题，反而暗示是司法机关“胡乱冻结”，并明确表示不会对损失进行任何赔偿。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">至今，汇友的银行卡依然处于被冻结状态。为核实情况，他还致电了当地反诈中心及属地派出所，得到明确答复：XM平台提供的那个收款账户也处于冻结状态。明明司法机关已鉴定，但平台就是不认账！</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">“看到的兄弟请远离这种平台吧，入金方式不可怕，怕的是如果真的遇到涉诈就给自己惹麻烦了”，汇友说道。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">XM的黑色档案</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">除了此次涉诈账户问题，这位汇友还指出了XM平台存在的其他问题，他提到平台“多次换网址”，以及在市场波动大时“不能入金导致多少人爆仓”的情况。而这些问题，在FX110网等投诉平台上，关于XM的投诉时有出现。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">事实上，在关于对XM的投诉帖中，问题远不止入金障碍。滑点严重、出金受阻、盈利被抹除、客服态度差等此类投诉更是数见不鲜。近年来，FX110网曝光了大量XM用户盈利无法出金的案例。例如，有用户成功交易后账户盈利2758美元，但提现时却被平台以“账户与另一个违规账户有关联”为由，直接扣除了2958美元（含本金）并关闭账户。还有用户注册不久，充值400美元盈利1057美元后，账户直接被关闭，本金和盈利全部被扣除。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"XM入金账户涉诈，六年老客户银行卡被冻、交易爆仓\" data-height=\"660px\" data-viewer=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2026/01/21/140345770.jpg\" data-width=\"514px\" src=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2026/01/21/140345770.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 8.09375px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%;\" title=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\">FX110网站关于XM的部分投诉帖</span></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">外汇行业一个长期存在的隐患</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">汇友遭遇的“涉诈账户”入金问题，实际上揭示了外汇行业一个长期存在的隐患。许多不受严格监管的平台常通过第三方支付渠道或私人账户收款，资金链路极不透明。一旦涉及诈骗资金链，对交易者的影响极为严重：轻则打乱生活节奏，中则造成财产损失，重则可能面临法律风险（洗钱指控）。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">更令人担忧的是，当用户因平台提供的入金渠道出现问题而遭受损失后，维权道路异常艰难。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">去年6月，一位FXCM的投资者也曝出过同样的遭遇，在一次向平台指定私人银行账号进行转账入金操作后，随即他名下的所有银行卡都被司法冻结，不仅交易账户受影响，连个人生活都几乎全部陷入“瘫痪”，而平台始终置身事外。详情点击<a href=\"https://www.chiefrich.com/special/13970\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; color: rgb(50, 50, 50); text-decoration: none; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">《福汇入金涉诈！中国用户全卡遭司法冻结，平台推责》</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">致富财经网提醒</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">外汇交易本就伴随着市场风险，而选择不靠谱的平台，无异于将自己置于更危险的境地。任何交易平台，如果其入金路径模糊不清、频繁更换收款方，或依赖个人账户、地下钱庄收款，本身就是一张巨大的“红牌警告”。你被承诺的“便捷”，其实是将你的资金安全彻底抛弃，并将由你承担全部风险！</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">选择往往比努力更重要，尤其是在金融安全领域。&nbsp;在寻求收益之前，首要评估的应是本金的安全边际。在入金前，多花一小时核查平台的监管状态、搜索其负面新闻与客诉记录，这份谨慎的成本远低于可能发生的巨额损失。</p>',0,11,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17207.html','2026-02-03 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:56:30'),(1375,22,NULL,'EC Markets 第四季度交易量增长2.6倍，创4.476万亿美元新高',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'全球领先的零售外汇及差价合约经纪商EC Markets近日公布2025年度业绩报告，其中第四季度交易量达到4.476万亿美元，创下公司单季度历史最高纪录，为全年业绩画上强劲句号。...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041073366_137ttd.jpg','<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">全球领先的零售外汇及差价合约经纪商EC Markets近日公布2025年度业绩报告，其中第四季度交易量达到4.476万亿美元，创下公司单季度历史最高纪录，为全年业绩画上强劲句号。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">2025年，EC Markets交易量保持持续增长态势：第一季度为1.737万亿美元，第二季度升至2.319万亿美元，第三季度达3.081万亿美元，第四季度进一步跃升至4.476万亿美元。<strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">全年累计，公司季度交易量规模增长2.6倍，较第一季度大幅提升157%。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">与此同时，公司平均月交易量从第一季度的5790亿美元增长至第四季度的1.492万亿美元；日均交易量也从276亿美元攀升至688亿美元，反映出其多资产交易平台上的全球客户活跃度显著增强。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">客户规模快速增长</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">报告期内，EC Markets的活跃交易者数量从第三季度的11.8万大幅增长至第四季度的23万，单季度内实现近翻倍增长。这一增长凸显了其全球外汇与差价合约服务的吸引力，进一步巩固了其作为受监管国际多资产经纪商的地位。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">交易结构多元化</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">资产分布方面，2025年第四季度EC Markets的交易量中仅有5%来自传统外汇交易，其余95%均来源于商品、指数、数字资产等其他类别，显示出其多资产交易环境的成熟与客户参与的多元化。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">公司表示，通过整合机构级流动性、先进执行技术及合规监管框架，EC Markets致力于在各种市场条件下为客户提供透明、稳定的交易体验。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">EC Markets全球营销总监Nicholas Xydas评论称：“第四季度的业绩体现了我们全球基础设施的实力与客户对我们的信任。一年内实现季度交易量增长2.6倍，这不仅反映了业务增长，更展现了我们的运营把控力与长期战略执行力。展望2026年，我们将继续聚焦创新、韧性与打造世界级的多资产交易环境。”</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">此外，EC Markets在2025年持续拓展全球布局，包括在墨西哥城设立拉丁美洲首个办事处，以及在毛里求斯启动运营，进一步推动其国际化发展战略。</p>',0,7,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17206.html','2026-02-03 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:56:05'),(1376,22,NULL,'美元进一步走强，延续周五受沃什提名影响的涨势',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'美元周一上涨，延续上周末强劲涨势，此前美国总统唐纳德·特朗普提名凯文·沃什(Kevin Warsh)担任新的美联储主席。...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041073707_s1axkf.jpg','<p style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246/0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Inter, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, Arial, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">智通财经APP获悉，<strong style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246/0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: 700;\">日本央行1月政策会议的会议纪要显示，在当局密切关注日元疲软对通胀的影响之际，决策层对及时加息必要性的认识正在增强。</strong><span style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246/0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235);\">根据会议纪要，日本央行九名政策委员会成员之一表示：“鉴于应对物价上涨是日本的当务之急，央行不应在评估上调政策利率影响方面耗费过多时间，而应把握适当时机，推进下一步行动——加息。”</span></p>\n<p style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246/0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Inter, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, Arial, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">这份会议纪要暗示，日本央行行长植田和男领导的政策委员会可能以快于市场共识的节奏上调基准利率。市场普遍预期，自去年12月上一次行动之后，日本央行大约每六个月才会加息一次。日元显然是一个关键因素——与上一次政策会议纪要相比，本次会议纪要中提及“日元疲软”和“外汇”的次数翻了一倍。</p>\n<p style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246/0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Inter, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, Arial, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">一名委员表示：“日元贬值以及长期收益率上升在很大程度上反映了通胀预期等基本面因素。在这种情况下，从货币政策角度来看，唯一的处方就是以及时且适当的方式上调政策利率。”</p>\n<p style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246/0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Inter, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, Arial, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">在1月政策会议上，日本央行释放出偏鹰派的信号，对通胀前景的上调幅度超过经济学家的预期，同时还出现了一个出人意料的、主张连续第二次加息的反对票。在会后的新闻发布会上，植田和男指出，有必要更加仔细地审视日元贬值对潜在通胀的影响。</p>\n<p style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246/0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Inter, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, Arial, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">法国巴黎银行和SMBC日兴证券等机构在1月会议之后，将日本央行下一次政策调整的时间预期提前至4月。即便是仍坚持下一次行动可能在6月或7月的机构，也越来越多地提示，在日元持续疲软的情况下，政策调整提前的风险正在上升。</p>\n<p style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246/0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Inter, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, Arial, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">一名委员表示：“如果日元进一步贬值，消费者物价指数(CPI)的涨幅下降速度可能会放缓、甚至重新加快。”数据显示，日本的关键通胀指标去年升至3.1%，连续第四年高于日本央行2%的目标，创下自1992年以来持续时间最长的一次。</p>\n<p style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246/0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Inter, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, Arial, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">政策委员会还讨论了日本首相高市早苗的财政措施对通胀的影响。高市早苗将于2月8日举行众议院的提前选举。投资者将关注这一选举结果将如何影响日本央行，因为有望获胜的高市早苗以支持货币宽松立场而闻名。</p>\n<p style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246/0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Inter, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, Arial, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">在最近一次日本央行会议上，一名内阁府代表暗示需要保持谨慎，称货币政策“极其重要”的一点在于，必须以有助于实现强劲经济增长和稳定通胀的方式来执行。</p>\n<p style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246/0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Inter, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, Arial, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">日元疲软预计仍将是日本央行和政府支持加息必要性的一个主要因素。鉴于日元可能推升通胀的风险，高市早苗被普遍认为在去年12月已放弃劝阻央行官员加息的尝试。生活成本飙升引发的家庭不满情绪，曾在她去年10月上任前，导致其所在的自民党在两次选举中遭遇重大挫折。</p>\n<p style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246/0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Inter, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, Arial, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">一名日本央行政策委员会成员表示：“虽然不能说央行落后于形势的风险必然变得更加明显，但央行以谨慎且及时的方式执行货币政策，正变得愈发重要。”</p>',0,5,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17205.html','2026-02-02 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:55:58');
INSERT INTO `cms_article` VALUES (1377,22,NULL,'全球乱局：美国失序与右翼抬头',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'世界正经历深刻动荡，美国政治失序与西方右翼回潮是核心驱动力。专家指出，这冲击全球经济，加剧国际冲突，预示世界步入多极化演变的阵痛期，各国需自力更生。变局中，单边主义消退也蕴含多边合作新机遇。...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041076299_ddynz9.jpg','<div class=\"news-detail-content cn\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 20px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; word-break: break-word; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">当前，世界正面临深刻的动荡与变革。美国库恩基金会主席罗伯特·库恩与北京外国语大学教授崔洪建在接受采访时，共同剖析了全球不稳定局势背后的核心驱动力：美国国内政治的失序和西方右翼势力的回潮。两位专家认为，世界格局正经历向多极化演变的阵痛期，变革与动荡将在未来交织前行。</p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px;\">美国政策失序：全球经济的“最大变量”</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">两位专家一致指出，美国国内政策的巨大不确定性，是当前全球不稳定的关键源头。其推行的单边主义，正持续冲击着全球经济贸易体系，并激化大国间的竞争风险。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">崔洪建分析称，特朗普政府的核心政策始终是“美国优先”。作为世界头号强国，美国的一系列不负责任行为，不仅加剧了全球治理的赤字，也实际上放弃了其应有的大国责任。例如，美国的关税政策虽然短期内能带来税收，但长期看，它既破坏了全球产业链供应链的稳定，也对美国自身的经济结构造成了负面冲击。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">面对美国的单边主义，各国正积极寻求对策。许多国家选择加强供应链的区域化布局，或将资本与产品引向更具性价比的市场。在这一背景下，加强自身经济韧性、深化区域合作已成为广泛共识。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">库恩则给出了一个更为明确的时间表。他直言，外界恐怕要等到2028年美国大选结束后，才可能看到美国政策恢复连续性。在此之前，世界无法指望一个稳定的美国。未来三年，全球局势或将更加动荡，因为各国已经认识到：不能依靠美国，只能依靠自己。</p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px;\">右翼政治回潮：民族主义与“情绪化”外交</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">近年来，民粹右翼势力在多个西方国家强势回归。从特朗普重返白宫，到有“女版安倍”之称的高市早苗出任日本首相，再到英法德等国民粹右翼政党支持率的持续攀升，这股浪潮正深刻影响着国际关系。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">库恩警告称，西方国家内部的民族主义情绪正在压倒传统的爱国主义。在社交媒体的放大作用下，这股力量使得国家间的政策与冲突变得高度情绪化，且更难预测。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">崔洪建认为，这种政治保守化趋势，在政策层面具体表现为日益严重的排外倾向，这不仅加剧了世界经济的碎片化，也让全球和区域治理变得异常艰难。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">然而，从更宏观的视角看，这或许是世界格局从单极向多极化演变的必经阶段。崔洪建指出，变革的浪潮与混乱的动荡将相伴而生。国际社会对重返“丛林法则”的警惕，恰恰可能倒逼各国合力维护多边主义，推动建立一个平等有序的多元化格局，最终摆脱历史的宿命。</p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px;\">两大冲突僵持：和平为何遥遥无期</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">在欧洲，乌克兰危机依然是地区安全面临的最严峻挑战。而在中东，巴以冲突虽暂时停火，但深层矛盾远未解决。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal; font-weight: 700;\">乌克兰：一场残酷的消耗战</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">库恩认为，没人相信特朗普所谓“24小时内解决冲突”的说法。目前，俄罗斯提出的和平条件远超乌克兰和欧洲的底线。尽管俄军在战场上占据主动，但冲突早已演变为一场对双方国力的残酷消耗。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">崔洪建则点明，冲突的核心矛盾，尤其是领土问题，双方立场并未改变。在此期间，美国不断借“促和”之名谋取私利，无论是与乌克兰达成矿产协议，还是意图染指俄罗斯被冻结的资产，都体现其一贯的霸权作风。同时，俄罗斯也无意配合美国设定的节奏，其目标是借此解决与西方的长期战略矛盾，而非一份简单的和平协议。因此，短期内很难形成一个稳固的和平框架。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal; font-weight: 700;\">巴以冲突：停火之下暗流涌动</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">库恩表示，巴以问题的复杂性远超乌克兰，以色列、哈马斯、真主党、伊朗等各方诉求不同。埃及、卡塔尔、土耳其等地区国家的斡旋至关重要，但需要更有效的手段。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">崔洪建则直指当前加沙停火协议的脆弱性，认为它并未触及深层问题，只是为了“符合特朗普的要求”。他提出了一系列无解的难题：哈马斯武装如何解除？以色列对加沙的武装控制能否实现可持续治理？战火是否会在约旦河西岸重燃？</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">“目前的停火仅仅是第一步，”崔洪建总结道，“接下来的每一步，都可能会比前一步更困难。”</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">总体来看，地区冲突的延宕、右翼势力的抬头与美国政策的失序共同构成了当前国际格局的动荡底色。但变局中也蕴含着新的机遇：单边主义的消退正催生多边合作的共识，各国自主发展的努力也在加速世界多极化的进程，这或许将为乱局中的世界，锚定一个和平的新方向。</p></div>\n<div class=\"risk_tips\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(142, 147, 157); line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<div class=\"risk_title\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">风险提示及免责条款</div>\n<div class=\"risk_text\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 16px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(194, 197, 204);\">市场有风险，投资需谨慎。本文内容仅供参考，不构成个人投资建议，也未考虑到某些用户特殊的投资目标、财务状况或其他需要。据此投资，责任自负。</div></div>',0,8,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17204.html','2026-02-02 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:55:56'),(1378,22,NULL,'美委破冰会谈，黄金市场遭遇“逆风”',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'美国与委内瑞拉高级外交官在加拉加斯重启会谈，预示两国关系有望告别多年紧张，走向结构性互动，甚至恢复正式外交。这一地缘政治降温引发黄金避险需求减弱，金价应声下跌。...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041078686_0uwxsz.jpg','<div class=\"news-detail-content cn\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 20px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; word-break: break-word; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">美国与委内瑞拉的高级外交官已在加拉加斯重启谈判。这一进展标志着两国在多年紧张关系后，正朝着建立结构性互动的方向迈出重要一步，甚至可能为恢复正式外交渠道铺平道路。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">对于黄金市场而言，这一动向短期内构成了负面压力。全球地缘政治版图上一个长期紧张点的潜在降温，削弱了黄金作为避险资产的部分吸引力。周一（2月2日）亚洲交易时段，现货黄金价格震荡走低，交投于每盎司4730美元附近，日内跌幅约2.6%。而在前一个交易日，金价已录得近10%的跌幅。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\"><img class=\"click-preview-img\" data-index=\"0\" src=\"https://img.fastbull.com/prod/image/2026/02/ADEF4B95B1C14CE386D4BA2E5E51C1E9.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px auto; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; width: auto; white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px;\">美委外交破冰：一场关键会谈</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">上周六（1月31日），美国驻委内瑞拉临时代办劳拉·多古抵达加拉加斯，与委内瑞拉外交部长伊万·吉尔举行了直接会晤。这次会议标志着双方正从长期的外交疏远，转向更为开放的沟通。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">会谈的核心议题是为改善双边关系和解决长期分歧寻找切实可行的步骤。委内瑞拉外交部表示，此次谈判是其更广泛努力的一部分，旨在为涉及共同利益的问题制定清晰的路线图，重点是通过外交机制而非单边行动来处理分歧。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">外长伊万·吉尔强调，对话必须建立在相互尊重和遵守国际法的基础上，这是任何可持续互动的前提。这番表态反映出，委内瑞拉将尊重主权视为持久外交的基础，而非自动意味着政策上的趋同。</p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px;\">华盛顿的下一步：试探性重返</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">华盛顿方面也释放了愿意保持接触的信号。劳拉·多古在社交平台上表示，她和她的团队已准备好在委内瑞拉开展工作。她曾担任美国驻尼加拉瓜和洪都拉斯大使，其经验为当前的外交接触增添了制度上的连续性。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">据双方官员证实，华盛顿已派遣工作组前往加拉加斯，评估分阶段恢复美国大使馆运营的可能性。自2019年两国断交以来，该使馆一直处于基本停摆状态。这一评估过程本身就表明，外交对话正与机构层面的重建相辅相成。任何使馆的重新开放都可能是循序渐进的，既反映了政治上的审慎，也考虑了后勤方面的现实。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">委内瑞拉当局透露，两国正在探索一个更具实质性的合作框架，涵盖政治、外交和经济等共同关切的议题。加拉加斯方面重申，所有交流都将在对话和尊重主权的基础上进行。尽管目前的讨论尚未解决结构性分歧，但双方在语气和程序上的调整，如果能够持续，可能会重塑未来的互动格局。</p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px;\">地缘政治降温如何冲击黄金？</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">对于市场交易员来说，美委关系从“外交疏远”转向“开放沟通”，并强调“通过外交而非单边行动解决分歧”，是一个重要的信号。如果这一趋势得以延续，可能意味着未来美国对委内瑞拉的极限施压政策（包括严厉制裁）或将缓和。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">地缘政治风险溢价的边际减弱，直接降低了市场的短期避险需求，从而对黄金价格构成压力。当国际冲突的风险下降时，投资者持有黄金以对冲不确定性的动机也会随之减弱。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\"><img class=\"click-preview-img\" data-index=\"1\" src=\"https://img.fastbull.com/prod/image/2026/02/C79246CD9BB240CC82BB118054B0D826.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px auto; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; width: auto; white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\"></p>\n<h4 data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(142, 147, 157); text-align: center;\">现货黄金日线图显示，金价在触及5596.33美元的高点后经历大幅回调，目前在4730美元附近盘整。地缘政治风险的缓和可能对其构成进一步的下行压力。</h4>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px;\">截至北京时间10:55，现货黄金报每盎司4726.77美元。</p></div>\n<div class=\"risk_tips\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(142, 147, 157); line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<div class=\"risk_title\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">风险提示及免责条款</div>\n<div class=\"risk_text\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 16px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(194, 197, 204);\">市场有风险，投资需谨慎。本文内容仅供参考，不构成个人投资建议，也未考虑到某些用户特殊的投资目标、财务状况或其他需要。据此投资，责任自负。</div></div>',0,6,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17203.html','2026-02-02 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:55:58'),(1379,22,NULL,'澳大利亚加息概率提高',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'近期澳大利亚公布的经济数据显示，其通胀压力显著超出市场预期。进口物价指数在2025年第四季度环比上涨0.9%，实现近三个季度以来首次正增长，年率亦上升至3%。这一回升主要由大宗商品短期供需变化及汇率波动推动，反映出输入型通胀压力有所抬头。...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041079056_c3apy1.jpg','<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">基本面总结：</h3>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal; font-weight: 700;\">1.澳大利亚通胀数据超预期推升加息概率，市场聚焦澳洲联储2月政策会议。</strong></div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">近期澳大利亚公布的经济数据显示，其通胀压力显著超出市场预期。进口物价指数在2025年第四季度环比上涨0.9%，实现近三个季度以来首次正增长，年率亦上升至3%。这一回升主要由大宗商品短期供需变化及汇率波动推动，反映出输入型通胀压力有所抬头。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">与此同时，衡量通胀黏性的关键指标——四季度经调整的平均消费者价格指数环比上升0.9%，年率升至3.4%，已突破澳洲联储2%-3%的目标区间。仅看12月单月，总体CPI环比涨幅扩大至1%，其中能源补贴结束、假日消费需求以及住房成本持续上涨，共同推高了整体通胀水平。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">在此数据影响下，主要金融机构纷纷调整对货币政策的预期。摩根大通此前设定的加息触发阈值已接近被触及，其原先认为联储将按兵不动的基准情景受到挑战。澳新银行、西太平洋银行等本土大型银行则一致转向鹰派，公开呼吁在2月政策会议上加息25个基点，并将其定性为一次“保险式”紧缩，未必意味着连续加息周期的开始。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">市场定价随之迅速反应，利率互换合约显示2月加息概率已攀升至74%左右。股市中利率敏感板块承受压力，债券收益率则在冲高后略有回落，显示投资者仍在等待政策信号的进一步明朗。澳洲联储副行长此前已排除降息可能性，为潜在的政策收紧做了铺垫。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">澳洲联储将于2月3日举行2026年首次货币政策会议。面对进口通胀与核心通胀的双重压力，市场普遍预期其很可能上调目前3.6%的现金利率。此次决议不仅将影响澳元汇率与本土资产价格，亦在全球主要央行政策分化的背景下，为观察大宗商品货币走向提供重要参照。如何权衡抑制通胀与维持经济增长，将成为此次会议的关键焦点。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal; font-weight: 700;\">2.特朗普提名沃什为美联储下任主席，市场关注其政策倾向与参议院确认前景。</strong></div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">美国总统特朗普上周五提名前美联储理事凯文·沃什为下一任美联储主席人选，接替将于5月任期结束的现任主席鲍威尔。此举被视为特朗普意图加强对货币政策影响的关键一步，为其长期以来批评美联储的立场寻求“制度变革”。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">若提名获参议院确认，沃什将执掌全球最重要的中央银行。他在此前美联储任期内以关注通胀著称，但近期政策观点倾向于支持降息，这呼应了特朗普多次公开呼吁降低借贷成本的要求。特朗普在社交媒体上盛赞沃什，称其为“完美人选”并相信“他将成为最伟大的主席之一”。有知情人士透露，沃什的外形气质也符合特朗普对央行行长形象的期待，是其从多位候选人中脱颖而出的因素之一。该提名亦得到了包括其岳父在内的多位特朗普支持者的推动。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">消息公布后，美国股市收跌。市场反应交织了对此人事变动的评估与近期通胀数据的影响，后者可能削弱美联储内部对降息的支持力度。美元汇率走强，国债收益率表现不一。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">提名后续将进入参议院确认程序，预计将面临激烈辩论。美联储的独立性将成为焦点，特朗普近年多次挑战该传统的做法已引发关切。参议院银行委员会关键共和党议员蒂利斯已表明，在司法部对鲍威尔的调查未获解决前，将反对任何美联储主席提名。特朗普对此回应称，若必要将等待其任期结束后再推动确认。委员会内亦有其他共和党人支持沃什，认为其能引导美联储回归核心职责。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">与此同时，现任主席鲍威尔虽将于5月卸任主席一职，但仍可选择留任美联储理事，以维护央行免受政治干预。特朗普政府亦正通过法律途径试图罢免另一位理事丽莎·库克，此事已上诉至最高法院，若成功将开创总统解雇央行决策者的先例。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal; font-weight: 700;\">3.美联储副主席鲍曼支持降息但赞同暂缓行动称需更多数据评估风险</strong></div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">美联储负责监管的副主席鲍曼上周五表示，她依然认为有必要降低利率，但在本月的政策会议上投票支持维持利率不变，旨在为下一次降息决策收集更多信息。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">鲍曼预计今年内仍需进行三次降息，每次幅度为0.25个百分点。她解释称，继去年下半年三次降息后，本次会议的重点在于选择后续行动的时机——是在4月会议上继续推进政策正常化，还是以更稳健的节奏逐步转向中性政策立场。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">她维持对经济风险的既有评估，认为通胀正接近2%的目标，但劳动力市场呈现疲软，因此需要实施更为宽松的货币政策。不过，她也注意到就业市场已出现一些企稳迹象，且考虑到去年秋季美国政府停摆造成的数据缺口，认为应等待至下次会议再决定是否将政策利率从当前3.50%-3.75%的区间下调。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">鲍曼表示，她本可投票支持继续放松政策，以对冲就业市场进一步恶化的风险，但目前选择暂时“保留政策火力”，以便仔细评估宽松政策对金融状况及劳动力市场的综合影响。她同时强调，任何暂停降息的做法都应是短暂的，不应传递出将在当前水平长期维持利率的政策信号。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">在上周三结束的美联储政策会议上，利率决定以10比2的投票结果获得通过，维持不变。此前外界曾认为鲍曼可能加入持异议的理事沃勒和米兰的行列，支持立即降息，但最终她选择了赞成多数派意见。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">北京时间本周一（2月2日），澳大利亚基本面暂无重要数据公布，市场焦点集中在晚间23:00公布的美国1月ISM制造业PMI。</div>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">经济资讯</h3>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal; font-weight: 700;\">澳大利亚经济面临严峻考验：加息“痛苦”在即，家庭债务危机加剧</strong></div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">通胀反弹迫使央行转向，加息已成定局。核心矛盾在于持续高企的通货膨胀。2025年第三季度消费者价格指数（CPI）出人意料地大幅上涨，打断了此前因通胀放缓而开启的降息进程。目前通胀率已回升至3.8%，远高于央行设定的2-3%目标区间。汇丰银行首席经济学家保罗·布洛克瑟姆指出，供给侧疲软（如生产力增长乏力）与出人意料扩张的财政政策（2025年中财政更新显示公共支出增长远超预期，约占GDP的1.7%）共同导致经济过热。产能利用率高企、失业率低于充分就业水平，均显示经济超出其可持续承载能力。因此，RBA除通过加息抑制需求外别无选择。市场预计2月将加息25个基点，且可能在5月再次行动，标志着货币政策的痛苦逆转。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">家庭债务压力临近临界点，社会影响深远。加息预期对澳大利亚社会构成了直接且严峻的挑战。据统计，约三分之一的澳大利亚人背负住房贷款，其中绝大多数为浮动利率。分析显示，仅0.25%的加息就可能将额外130万家庭推向抵押贷款压力的境地。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">澳大利亚金融咨询协会的报告揭示了危机的广泛性：2025年上半年，拨打国家债务热线的求助者中，高达44%为有薪就业人员（30%为全职），完全颠覆了财务困境仅困扰低收入群体的传统认知。高达11%的求助者已面临抵押贷款压力。许多家庭正通过错过医疗预约、减少餐食等极端方式节省开支，心理健康问题与财务压力交织。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal;\">政治与政策困境：当前的困境根源可追溯至新冠疫情期间的紧急低利率环境，以及后续通胀失控导致的激进加息周期。2025年的三次降息被证明是误判，如今央行被迫进行政策“U型转弯”。这对希望稳定经济的财政部长吉姆·查尔默斯而言不啻为一场政治噩梦。尽管银行鼓励陷入困境的借款人尽早沟通以寻求援助，但许多借款人因压力而逃避问题，导致债务与精神健康危机恶化。</span></div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">总结而言，澳大利亚经济在2026年初站在了十字路口：央行必须通过加息对抗通胀，但此举将直接刺痛早已因生活成本危机和极高负债而脆弱不堪的广大家庭。政策制定者正面临控制通胀与避免引发社会性债务危机的艰难平衡，其决策将深刻影响澳大利亚全年的经济与社会稳定。</div>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal; font-weight: 700;\">政治资讯</span></h3>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal; font-weight: 700;\">澳大利亚政府达成关键拨款协议，反对党陷入领导层危机</strong></div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal;\">政府与各州达成里程碑式医院拨款协议。经过数月紧张谈判，阿尔巴尼斯总理领导的国家内阁于1月30日周五达成一项关键协议。联邦政府承诺在未来五年内，为公立医院系统额外提供250亿澳元资金，这是总额近2200亿澳元创纪录拨款的一部分。此举旨在落实2023年的承诺，即将联邦资金份额逐步提高至45%。</span></div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">作为交换条件，各州及领地同意在“茁壮成长儿童计划”等项目中承担更多责任，以减轻国家残疾保险计划（NDIS）的财政压力。该计划将为患有轻度至中度发育问题的儿童提供支持，预定于2026年10月1日启动，2028年全面实施。同时，国家内阁同意为NDIS设定更严格的年度支出增长目标，即不高于6%，以控制其长期成本。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">卫生部长马克·巴特勒承认，谈判一度因资金增长上限等问题陷入僵局，甚至出现“吝啬鬼”的指责。此次协议的达成，不仅避免了南澳大利亚州因进入选举看守期而可能导致的谈判停滞，也被阿尔巴尼斯誉为“近年来最重要的国家改革之一”，旨在确保医疗与残疾人服务体系的可持续性。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal;\">反对党联盟内讧加剧，领导地位风雨飘摇，与政府的“团结”形成鲜明对比，反对党阵营正经历严重的领导层动荡与联盟裂痕。</span></div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">在自由党内部，针对党魁苏珊·莱伊的领导权挑战暗流汹涌。尽管后座议员安德鲁·哈斯蒂公开宣布因缺乏足够支持而退出竞争，但影子财长安格斯·泰勒与其他保守派议员此前举行的秘密会议照片被曝光，引发对其忠诚度的广泛质疑。前总理托尼·阿博特已公开介入，呼吁保守派团结在泰勒或哈斯蒂周围。影子内阁成员虽公开表态支持莱伊，但党内普遍预计挑战可能在数月内发生。卫生部长巴特勒借此抨击反对党“专注于内斗而非国家利益”。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">与此同时，国家党领袖大卫·利特普劳德也因其决定在工党“仇恨言论法案”问题上与自由党决裂而面临党内挑战。弗林选区议员科林·博伊斯已提出动议，要求罢免其领导职务并推动联盟重新团结。国家党定于下周初就此进行表决。莱伊已向利特普劳德发出最后通牒，要求国家党在下周末前回归联盟，否则分裂可能永久化。</div>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">金融资讯</h3>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">上周五，标普/澳交所200指数下跌0.7%，收于8869点，连续第三个交易日走低，但本月累计上涨1.8%，创下8月以来最大单月涨幅。此轮上涨主要得益于黄金和基本金属价格的月度大幅上涨，投资者在地缘政治风险加剧和美元走软的背景下纷纷转向实物资产。然而，由于金属价格飙升至历史新高，投资者纷纷获利了结，原材料类股回吐了早盘涨幅。矿业巨头必和必拓(BHP)股价下跌1.8%，力拓(Rio Tinto)股价暴跌3.5%，此前该公司与东大铝业(Chinalco)联手收购了巴西铝生产商CBA的多数股权。黄金矿业股也出现回落，其中纽蒙特(Newmont)领跌，跌幅超过8%。另一方面，能源股小幅上涨0.1%，创下六个月高位，原因是全球供应风险加剧，油价上涨。石油生产商桑托斯股价上涨 2.5%，此前澳大利亚第二大天然气出口州昆士兰州向该公司颁发了三份新的天然气勘探许可证。</div>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">地缘战事</h3>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal; font-weight: 700;\">周末全球地缘资讯：多线冲突同步升级，和平进程步履维艰</strong></div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal;\">乌克兰：战场袭击与脆弱停火下的艰难谈判。上周末，乌克兰冲突在残酷袭击与脆弱的外交希望间摇摆。周日，俄罗斯无人机袭击了第聂伯罗彼得罗夫斯克州一辆载有下班矿工的巴士，造成至少12人死亡，基辅谴责其为针对能源工人的“蓄意攻击”。与此同时，乌克兰正经历严冬，能源系统在数月打击后极度脆弱，首都基辅仍有数百栋公寓楼未能恢复供暖。</span></div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">在此背景下，由美国斡旋的新一轮三方和谈定于2月4日至5日在阿布扎比举行。泽连斯基总统表示已准备好进行“实质性”讨论，以期体面结束战争。此前，应特朗普总统要求，俄罗斯同意暂停袭击乌能源基础设施至上周日，乌方予以对等回应。然而，双方根本分歧依旧：莫斯科坚持要求乌方割让东部领土，而基辅断然拒绝。战场的持续流血与严寒中的民生危机，为即将到来的谈判蒙上沉重阴影。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal;\">加沙：停火协议濒临破裂，平民伤亡激增。中东方面，加沙地带的临时停火协议在上周末濒临崩溃。周六，以色列发动了自2023年10月战争以来“最猛烈的空袭”，袭击目标包括房屋、帐篷营地及警察局，造成至少32名巴勒斯坦人死亡，其中包括三名年幼的女孩。以军称此举是对前一天哈马斯武装人员从拉法隧道出现的回应。自停火以来，此类暴力循环已造成500多名巴勒斯坦人和4名以色列士兵死亡。</span></div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">尽管暴力升级，特朗普总统旨在“彻底结束冲突”的和平计划仍在推进，其下一阶段涉及哈马斯解除武装、以色列进一步撤军及部署国际部队等复杂议题。然而，哈马斯寻求将其上万名警察纳入美国支持的新加沙管理机构，此举可能遭到以色列强烈反对，显示和平之路依然障碍重重。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal;\">美伊关系：军事对峙升级与外交博弈同步。波斯湾地区，美国与伊朗的紧张关系在上周末达到新的危险高度。为回应伊朗镇压国内抗议及核问题僵局，特朗普政府加强了在中东的海军存在。伊朗最高领袖哈梅内伊周日警告，任何美国攻击都将引发强力反击，但同时透露双方正通过地区盟友进行接触。</span></div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">象征性的对抗亦在加剧：欧盟于上周四正式将伊朗伊斯兰革命卫队列为“恐怖组织”；作为报复，伊朗议会次日通过动议，将欧盟军队认定为恐怖组织，并考虑驱逐欧盟国家武官。尽管剑拔弩张，双方均未关闭外交大门。特朗普表示希望达成“双方都能接受的协议”，而德黑兰则要求“公平”谈判。军事威慑与外交试探并行，使得该地区局势处于高度不确定状态。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; white-space: normal;\">美以高层密会：协调应对地区危机。在此敏感时刻，美国参谋长联席会议主席丹·凯恩将军与以色列国防军总参谋长埃亚尔·扎米尔于上周五在五角大楼举行了秘密会谈。尽管细节未公开，但此举发生在美以关系因加沙局势及美国对伊朗政策而面临压力之际。随后，扎米尔回国即与以防长评估“作战准备”，以应对“任何可能情况”，暗示双方正就应对伊朗等地区威胁进行紧密战略协调。</span></div>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">技术谋攻</h3>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">上周澳币兑美元汇率走势受美元指数波动与澳洲本土通胀基本面共振主导，整体呈现冲高回落但站稳高位的震荡格局。周一开盘，受美联储内部分歧加剧引发政策不确定性、市场对美元信用的担忧升温影响，美元指数跳空低开并延续弱势，叠加澳洲此前核心通胀超预期已提前推升市场加息押注，澳币兑美元同步跳空高开，且在后续几个交易日依托美澳利差预期扩大的支撑延续上行势头。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">上周四，美元指数再度回落，同时澳洲四季度进口物价指数超预期回升的消息进一步强化进口端通胀压力与加息预期，多重利好推动澳币兑美元盘中进一步上行，一度触及0.7092水平，刷新2023年2月以来的高位。不过澳币的上行势头并未持续，随着美元指数跌至超卖区间后触发技术性修复，后半周重拾反弹动能，叠加澳币冲高至两年多高位附近后获利了结盘集中涌现，澳币兑美元逐步承压回落，周内低位下探至0.6900整数关口，该位置也成为近期汇价震荡的关键支撑位。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">尽管出现这一波技术性回调，但澳币兑美元本周整体仍维持在近期高位区间内整理，并未出现趋势性走弱，反映出当前市场对澳币的多空判断仍处于相持阶段。 当前澳币的上行动能仍具备多重基本面支撑，澳洲通胀数据接连超预期推升的2月加息预期、美澳货币政策分化带来的利差优势，以及黄金、铜、铁矿石等大宗商品价格走强对商品货币的提振，均为澳币提供了较强的底部支撑，法国兴业银行此前便指出，在美元避险属性弱化的背景下，澳币凭借高收益特征成为市场偏好的“高收益避险货币”，这一属性也让其在回调中获得有效支撑；而短期的压制则主要来自美元指数的技术性反弹、汇价冲高后的技术面调整，尚未出现扭转澳币中期强势的利空因素，也让多空双方在高位形成暂时的平衡。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">从日线技术指标来看，澳币兑美元当前价仍运行于布林带中轨与上轨之间的强势区间，多头力量占据主导地位，汇率短期上行趋势明确。与此同时，布林带通道持续开口扩张，反映市场波动率正稳步抬升，也进一步印证汇率的趋势性上行动能在持续增强。目前布林带上轨于0.7050区域形成短期动态阻力，中轨已上移至0.6800附近，成为划分短期多空强弱的关键分界线，而下轨则延伸至0.6540区域，构成阶段性动态支撑位。动能指标层面，14日相对强弱指数（RSI）从80的极端超买区间回落至70，虽仍处于超买区间，但已体现出多头动能在前期快速释放后的衰减迹象，市场短线回调压力有所抬升，需保持警惕。从日线趋势结构分析，澳币兑美元上周初成功站稳0.6900整数关口后进一步延续强势，尽管上周五出现回调走势，但在守稳0.6900区域水平前，日线级别上行趋势结构仍保持完整，汇价或在回调修正后重启上行节奏。若后续能成功站稳0.7100整数关口上方，汇率上行空间将进一步打开，目标可看至0.7290甚至更高水平；反之，若0.6900区域支撑失守，日线级别的上行趋势结构将遭到初步破坏，汇价下行风险同步显著增加，短期内或进一步回撤至0.6750区域展开整理。</div>\n<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><img alt=\"澳大利亚加息概率提高_1\" class=\"click-preview-img\" data-index=\"0\" src=\"https://img.fastbull.com/prod/image/2026/02/03F8E415E431404C80A7734481087297.png\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px auto; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; width: auto; white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\" title=\"澳大利亚加息概率提高_1\"></div>',0,6,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17202.html','2026-02-02 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:56:06'),(1380,22,NULL,'印度税收新规，苹果成大赢家',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'印度政府调整税收政策，允许外企为合作制造商提供设备并五年免税，此举被视为对苹果等巨头的重大利好。它解决了跨国公司在印度的税务困境，旨在吸引高端制造业投资。...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041079408_2rg8c9.jpg','<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">印度政府近日宣布一项关键税收政策调整，允许外国公司在特定区域为其合作的制造商提供生产设备，并给予为期五年的税收豁免。这项新规被普遍视为对苹果公司等跨国巨头的重大利好。</p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">解决苹果最大的税务烦恼</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">过去，苹果在印度扩张一直面临一个棘手的税务难题。如果苹果公司自行采购昂贵的组装设备并提供给印度的代工厂，根据当地法律，这种行为可能被认定为构成“商业联系”（business connection）。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">一旦被如此认定，苹果就需要为其代工厂的利润缴纳税款，这无疑增加了其在印度生产的成本和风险。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">而最新的政策彻底改变了这一局面。新规明确，如果苹果为设在印度海关保税区内的代工厂进口设备，不仅在五年内无需缴纳关税等税费，还能享受后续的税收优惠。具体来说，只有当这些设备生产的产品进入印度国内市场时，才需要补缴税款；如果产品主要用于出口，则将免除其他相关税费。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">这一调整直接减轻了代工厂的启动资金压力，无疑会鼓励更多外资企业将高端制造业布局到印度。</p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">政策转向背后的博弈</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">近年来，苹果在印度的业务版图持续扩大。根据Counterpoint Research的数据，自2022年以来，iPhone在印度制造的份额增长了四倍，已占到总量的25%，而中国市场则占据了全球iPhone出货量的75%。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">然而，美国总统特朗普时期的关税政策一度对苹果的印度业务造成冲击，阻碍了其扩张计划。与此同时，其主要竞争对手三星因为在印度自建工厂，在设备进口方面并没有遇到苹果这样的税务担忧。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">据报道，为了扫清障碍，苹果在过去几个月里与印度官员进行了多次沟通，推动相关法律的修订。这成为印度政府此次调整政策框架的直接原因之一。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">印度税务局长Arvind Shrivastava对此表示，这项政策意味着，只要外国企业带来的机器被印度制造商用于生产，政府就将在未来五年内免除相关税收，目的是为企业提供更多的确定性。</p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">行业反响与更广泛影响</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">这项政策的出台迅速获得了专业人士的积极评价。印度税务律师事务所BMR Legal的合伙人Shankey Agrawal指出，这项免税政策消除了印度电子制造业面临的一项重大失败风险，将帮助全球电子企业更有信心地在印度扩大生产规模。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">除了针对电子制造业，印度的政策利好也在向其他领域延伸。印度财政部长Nirmala Sitharaman上周日宣布，在印度运营数据中心的外国公司，如果其服务对象在境外，那么到2047年之前都将免缴海外服务税。当然，为印度本地提供的服务仍需照常缴税。</p>',0,13,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17201.html','2026-02-02 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:56:17'),(1381,22,NULL,'金银闪崩，货币贬值交易还没完',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'自2025年鲍威尔鸽派转向以来，围绕货币贬值与债务货币化的交易持续。尽管近期金银剧烈回调，但宏观债务压力未改，市场对美联储长期宽松预期依然稳固，预示此轮交易远未结束。...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041079747_sa191g.jpg','<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">自2025年8月美联储主席鲍威尔在杰克逊霍尔会议上释放鸽派信号以来，一场围绕“货币贬值”的交易便拉开序幕。其核心逻辑在于，面对巨额公共债务和政治压力，美联储可能被迫将政策重心从抑制通胀转向支持经济，通过降息来稀释货币价值。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">尽管近期黄金和白银价格经历了剧烈回调，但这并未从根本上动摇市场对美联储长期宽松以及美元信用的担忧。因此，这场基于货币贬值与债务货币化逻辑的交易，预计将继续成为驱动黄金等资产长线走势的核心动力。</p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">交易的起点：鲍威尔的鸽派转向</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">这场交易的真正升温始于8月22日，当时鲍威尔在杰克逊霍尔全球央行年会上发表了关键讲话。此前，美联储一直处于两难境地：一边是疲软的劳动力市场，另一边是高于目标的通胀。在2024年降息100个基点后，美联储在2025年一直按兵不动，这引起了时任总统特朗普的强烈不满。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">鲍威尔的讲话之所以关键，是因为他做出了选择——将劳动力市场置于通胀之上。这个信号非常明确：尽管通胀依然高企，美联储仍将恢复降息。市场合理地怀疑，这背后有来自特朗普的持续施压。于是，“货币贬值交易”应运而生，作为其直接表现的贵金属价格开始飙升。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><img alt=\"金银闪崩，货币贬值交易还没完_1\" class=\"click-preview-img\" data-index=\"0\" src=\"https://img.fastbull.com/prod/image/2026/02/CC4A9866A5F347E0862D567476CCCF32.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px auto; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; width: auto; white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\" title=\"金银闪崩，货币贬值交易还没完_1\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">宏观逻辑不变：债务压力下的政策路径</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">从基本面来看，即便美联储主席提名人选变为凯文·沃什，宏观大背景也未曾改变。美国高企且不断攀升的公共债务正在推高长期收益率，这必然导致美联储面临更大的政治压力，被要求降息并限制长期收益率。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">换言之，无论下一任美联储主席是谁，市场寻求债务货币化作为避风港的需求不会消失。因此，这场“货币贬值交易”仍有很长的路要走。</p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">市场误判？两大细节揭示真相</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">除了宏观背景，还有两个关键点表明，当前的贬值交易远未结束。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">首先，市场可能误读了凯文·沃什。上周五贵金属的暴跌，似乎是市场将他视为鹰派的反应。然而，期货市场的走势却给出了相反的信号：市场预期未来会有更多的降息，这对货币贬值交易是根本性的利好。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><img alt=\"金银闪崩，货币贬值交易还没完_2\" class=\"click-preview-img\" data-index=\"1\" src=\"https://img.fastbull.com/prod/image/2026/02/A1B69C04FA984F9EB202859C817FEF4D.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px auto; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; width: auto; white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\" title=\"金银闪崩，货币贬值交易还没完_2\"></p>\n<h4 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(142, 147, 157); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\">图：美国2年期国债收益率在沃什提名消息后不升反降，市场预期其政策偏鸽</h4>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">上图显示，在特朗普于上午6:48正式宣布提名沃什后，2年期美债收益率随即开始下跌。尽管8:30公布的12月生产者价格通胀数据高于预期，收益率短暂回升，但随后恢复跌势直至收盘。这清晰地表明，市场认为沃什在利率政策上将偏向鸽派。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">其次，这次暴跌只是技术性回调，远未破坏上涨趋势。上周五白银暴跌近27%、黄金暴跌近10%确实令人震惊，但必须看到，这轮下跌发生在此前贵金属价格大幅飙升之后，仅仅是将价格拉回到了几周前的水平。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><img alt=\"金银闪崩，货币贬值交易还没完_3\" class=\"click-preview-img\" data-index=\"2\" src=\"https://img.fastbull.com/prod/image/2026/02/1D20669207D948298EBC2D80E81D5B56.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px auto; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; width: auto; white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\" title=\"金银闪崩，货币贬值交易还没完_3\"></p>\n<h4 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(142, 147, 157); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\">图：现货白银日线图显示，价格在经历大幅上涨后急剧回调，但仍处于高位</h4>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">如图所示，白银近27%的跌幅使其价格回落至1月9日的水平。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><img alt=\"金银闪崩，货币贬值交易还没完_4\" class=\"click-preview-img\" data-index=\"3\" src=\"https://img.fastbull.com/prod/image/2026/02/D3FC3CBEA6B54E68A35406D773F28042.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px auto; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; width: auto; white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\" title=\"金银闪崩，货币贬值交易还没完_4\"></p>\n<h4 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(142, 147, 157); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\">图：现货黄金日线图显示，金价在上周五回调近10%，但仅仅回吐了部分涨幅</h4>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">而黄金近10%的跌幅，也只是将价格拉回到1月20日的水平。因此，上周五的回调对“货币贬值交易”的整体结构冲击甚微，交易逻辑依然稳固。市场普遍预计，贵金属价格将像10月回调后那样，很快再度回升。</p>',0,8,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17200.html','2026-02-02 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:56:17'),(1382,22,NULL,'比特币为何突然崩盘：复盘双重冲击',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'比特币遭遇急剧抛售，失守关键支撑位，源于科技股泡沫担忧与美联储鹰派换帅疑云双重冲击，市场流动性稀薄更将恐慌放大。短期波动剧烈，但长期基本面未变。...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041080081_tmez1c.jpg','<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">科技股“泡沫”破裂，比特币失守关键支撑</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">比特币市场毫无征兆地迎来了一场急剧抛售，价格在1月29日从87,000美元附近开始下挫，一路跌破80,000美元大关，让许多投资者措手不及。与股票和大宗商品在短暂回调后迅速反弹不同，比特币的反弹之路显得尤为艰难。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">这轮下跌并非单一利空引爆，而是传统金融市场与货币政策不确定性共同作用的结果。而贯穿始终的核心问题是：比特币现货和期货市场的交易量持续萎缩，流动性极度稀薄，导致任何风吹草动都可能被无限放大。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">第一轮冲击始于1月29日。当天，纳斯达克指数因微软第四季度财报不及预期而大幅下跌，市场对AI投资泡沫的担忧情绪迅速升温。恐慌之下，投资者开始抛售高风险资产，而高波动性的比特币首当其冲。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">这次下跌之所以如此沉重，是因为比特币失守了一个至关重要的技术点位——约87,000美元的“活跃实现价”（Active Realized Price）。这个指标剔除了长期不活跃的持仓，只计算市场中频繁交易的比特币的平均成本。简单来说，它就是活跃交易者的“盈亏线”。一旦价格跌破该水平，意味着大部分场内玩家都陷入了亏损状态，从而引发了更大规模的抛售。</p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">美联储换帅疑云，流动性恐慌再起</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">市场的恐慌情绪尚未平复，第二轮冲击接踵而至。1月29日晚间，比特币价格从84,000美元再次跳水至81,000美元。起因是彭博社和路透社报道称，特朗普正准备提名凯文·沃什（Kevin Warsh）为下一任美联储主席。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">凯文·沃什在市场眼中是一位旗帜鲜明的“鹰派”人物。他在2006至2011年担任美联储理事期间，一贯反对量化宽松政策，并反复警告其通胀风险。2011年，他因反对第二轮量化宽松而辞职。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">因此，市场将沃什可能上任的消息解读为货币政策收紧的信号，这与特朗普希望降息的意愿背道而驰。加密货币市场历来依赖充裕的流动性，投资者担忧沃什上台会抽干市场的资金。在流动性本就紧张的背景下，这种担忧迅速转化为实际的抛售压力，导致比特币价格进一步下挫。</p>\n<h3 style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">短期风险犹存，长期逻辑未变</h3>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">尽管市场对沃什的鹰派立场充满忧虑，但实际政策的执行可能并不会像预想的那样极端。沃什本人曾在《华尔街日报》的专栏中提出过一个折中方案：在有限降息的同时，收缩美联储的资产负债表。这被看作是在特朗普的降息意愿与他自己的通胀纪律之间寻找平衡。这意味着，即使沃什掌舵美联储，政策总基调可能偏鹰，但不太可能完全逆转渐进式宽松的方向。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">与此同时，加密货币的宏观环境依然在改善。美国证券交易委员会（SEC）和商品期货交易委员会（CFTC）正逐步推进对行业友好的政策。其中，允许将加密资产纳入401(k)退休金账户的提案，有望为市场打开高达1万亿美元的潜在资金入口。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">短期来看，不确定性依然是市场的主旋律。比特币价格跌破80,000美元后，下行风险不容忽视，其走势很可能继续受美股表现的牵动。但从历史经验看，当科技股因泡沫担忧而停滞时，资金往往会轮动到比特币等替代性资产中。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 30px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Inter, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 18px; line-height: 30px; color: rgb(31, 37, 51); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">更重要的是，比特币的中长期基本面并未动摇。全球流动性扩张的大趋势仍在继续，机构投资者也在持续、有序地进行战略性配置，比特币网络本身运行良好。当前的价格回调，更多是市场在流动性枯竭下对短期冲击的过度反应，并未改变其长期的核心价值逻辑。</p>',0,7,'https://www.chiefrich.com/edu/17199.html','2026-02-02 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:55:58'),(1407,23,NULL,'Xlence上演“盈利消失术”！直接以一句“最终决定”让用户申诉无门',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'近日，又一位汇友遭遇了Xlence平台的霸道行径：其账户中的盈利被平台毫无预警地直接抹除。更令人震惊的是，平台在没有提供任何证据、没有给出合理解释的情况下，仅以一句\"最终决定\"...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041310613_tu1kyc.jpg','<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">近日，又一位汇友遭遇了Xlence平台的霸道行径：其账户中的盈利被平台毫无预警地直接抹除。更令人震惊的是，平台在没有提供任何证据、没有给出合理解释的情况下，仅以一句\"最终决定\"就打发了用户的质询。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">盈利570美元遭霸道拒付</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">据汇友叙述，他在Xenice平台完成了存款手续并开始了正常的交易活动。该平台声称自己受到塞舌尔金融服务管理局（FSA）牌照SD029（Tradeco&nbsp;Limited）的监管，给人一种合规可靠的印象。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">交易过程中，汇友成功执行了几笔盈利交易。当他试图提取其中570.98美元的盈利时，问题出现了。Xlence平台以“场外交易”为由拒绝了他的提款请求，但却无法提供任何具体的证据来支持这一指控——没有时间戳、没有价格数据，没有任何能够证明汇友存在违规行为的实质性证据。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Xlence上演“盈利消失术”！直接以一句“最终决定”让用户申诉无门\" data-height=\"1070px\" data-viewer=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2025/09/15/171525831.jpg\" data-width=\"2160px\" height=\"322\" src=\"https://www.chiefrich.com/d/file/p/ea56723ba54fb95a575149978ccfc706.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 8.1px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%;\" title=\"\" width=\"650\"></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">为证明自己的清白，这位汇友甚至向平台提供了所有交易的现场屏幕录像，充分证明自己没有违反任何交易规则。然而，Xenice平台完全无视这些证据，坚持拒绝提款请求。更令人震惊的是，平台在未经汇友允许的情况下，擅自将他的资金转移到了自己的内部账户中。当汇友再次与客服支持人员联系时，对方只表示这个决定是“最终决定”，并拒绝进一步讨论此事。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">面对平台的强硬态度，汇友不得不向塞舌尔金融服务管理局（FSA）提出了投诉。但遗憾的是，几周时间过去了，监管机构仍然没有给出任何回应。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Xlence上演“盈利消失术”！直接以一句“最终决定”让用户申诉无门\" data-height=\"1240px\" data-viewer=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2025/09/15/171614113.jpg\" data-width=\"2123px\" height=\"380\" src=\"https://www.chiefrich.com/d/file/p/eec54cba6ccb120a901fd95cfe463083.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 8.1px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%;\" title=\"\" width=\"650\"></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">众多用户一致声讨，提现困难客服失效</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">汇友的遭遇并非个例。在其他交易社区，许多用户报告了与Xlence相似的糟糕体验。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">一位Xlence用户报告称：“提现功能无法使用，客服形同虚设，问题迟迟未解”。对方的邮件永远只会敷衍地回复“正在处理中，请耐心等待”，既拿不出解决方案，也不提供实质帮助。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">用户补充道：“我这辈子从没见过比Xlence更糟糕的公司！客服系统完全瘫痪，每次联系都被当皮球踢来踢去。虽然他们声称是技术故障，但整整几天都不修复不解决……发了无数邮件和在线消息都石沉大海，让人感觉完全被抛弃。”</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Xlence上演“盈利消失术”！直接以一句“最终决定”让用户申诉无门\" data-height=\"564px\" data-viewer=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2025/09/15/171303894.jpg\" data-width=\"626px\" src=\"https://www.chiefrich.com/d/file/p/e6339385869e2189a17091d3c9c283f6.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 8.1px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%;\" title=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">另一位用户分享了其经历：“起初一切似乎都很顺利——存款到账快，账户设置也无任何麻烦。但这仅仅是好体验的结束。”当涉及提现时，即使是小额资金（例如1000美元），整个过程也变得异常缓慢且令人沮丧。客服的回复粗鲁且毫无帮助。更糟糕的是，平台无法查看之前的聊天记录，这让人怀疑是故意让追踪沟通变得困难。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">最令人无法接受的是，当该用户尝试使用同一张之前成功交易过的银行卡存款时，客服人员以“姓名未完全匹配”为由拒绝了交易，尽管此前从未出现过此问题。用户指出：“他们之前接受同一张卡时没有提出任何异议，如今却这样做，既不合理也更显前后矛盾。”</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">“总的来说，Xlence似乎更关心如何让存款变得容易，而让提现变得困难——这是一个巨大的危险信号。请不惜一切代价避免使用该平台！”</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Xlence上演“盈利消失术”！直接以一句“最终决定”让用户申诉无门\" data-height=\"839px\" data-viewer=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2025/09/15/171327285.jpg\" data-width=\"626px\" src=\"https://www.chiefrich.com/d/file/p/021a4480b7a678086c808ff127f61649.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 8.1px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%;\" title=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">监管牌照存疑，离岸监管保障薄弱</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Xlence在其官方网站（https://www.xlence.com/en）上声称是 Tradeco Limited 的商业名称。Tradeco Limited 由塞舌尔金融服务管理局FSA授权并监管，许可证号为 SD029。这初看之下似乎具备一定的合规性。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Xlence上演“盈利消失术”！直接以一句“最终决定”让用户申诉无门\" data-height=\"288px\" data-viewer=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2025/09/15/171655347.png\" data-width=\"1455px\" height=\"129\" src=\"https://www.chiefrich.com/d/file/p/6bf8505963ad88d08b9344e19b6eccb2.png\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 8.1px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%;\" title=\"\" width=\"650\"></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">然而经过深入调查发现，Tradeco Limited的合法注册信息实际上指向的是另一家名为T4Trade的交易平台，而非Xlence，登记网址为www.t4trade.com。在塞舌尔FSA官网上的监管记录也没有提及Xlence网站的任何关联信息。这意味着Xlence可能并不具备其所宣称的监管地位，而是借用他人合法身份进行包装。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Xlence上演“盈利消失术”！直接以一句“最终决定”让用户申诉无门\" data-height=\"588px\" data-viewer=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2025/09/15/171735253.png\" data-width=\"610px\" src=\"https://www.chiefrich.com/d/file/p/3ba09ad33d11f6f0f9732c188ebb1c94.png\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 8.1px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%;\" title=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">退一万步讲，即便Xlence所言不虚，但塞舌尔FSA作为离岸监管，其保障力度也相当有限。再者，英国金融行为监管局（FCA）早已将T4Trade列入其风险警示名单。在这种背景下，建议投资者还是谨慎选择。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Xlence上演“盈利消失术”！直接以一句“最终决定”让用户申诉无门\" data-height=\"595px\" data-viewer=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2025/09/15/171759847.jpg\" data-width=\"800px\" height=\"483\" src=\"https://www.chiefrich.com/d/file/p/fe06f991adba0ddc6a4b7a69b10fba1f.jpg\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 8.1px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%;\" title=\"\" width=\"650\"></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">小编提醒</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">随着在线交易的普及，越来越多的普通投资者进入外汇市场，但他们往往缺乏对平台运营模式和风险特征的基本了解，极易成为不良平台的猎物。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">现在盈利不能出金的理由越来越多了，大部分还是以用户违规交易为由阻止的，而针对此办法，只能说在入金前，一定要和平台确认清楚他们的交易规则，包括交易手法的要求，避免出现自己的交易手法与平台规定的相冲突，就是违规交易，不给出金的。切记：投资路上，远离那些监管不明、投诉频发的交易平台。</p>',0,4,'https://www.chiefrich.com/broker/17176.html','2025-09-29 08:00:00','2026-06-22 16:56:29'),(1408,23,NULL,'环球智选不给出金',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scraped',NULL,'环球智选不给出金投诉单号：204032投诉平台：环球智选投诉类型：出入金问题维权诉求：赔偿交易损失，索还交易资金维权金额：投诉进度：处理中\n\n...','/public/uploads/default/image/2026/05/29/1780041310915_rkgdkr.png','<h1 class=\"main_title\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 600; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 22px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 30px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">环球智选不给出金</h1>\n<div class=\"complaint_info_box\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 16px 0px 32px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-tran