com/BTC/24h\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; text-decoration: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial; color: rgb(0, 129, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word;\" target=\"_blank\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">加密货币</font></font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">市场做空意味着在预期价格下跌的情况下出售一种并不实际拥有的</font></font><a href=\"https://crypto.cnyes.com/BTC/24h\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; text-decoration: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial; color: rgb(0, 129, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word;\" target=\"_blank\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">加密货币</font></font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">，然后以更便宜的成本买回以平仓，并从价格下跌中获利。</font></font><a href=\"https://crypto.cnyes.com/BTC/24h\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; text-decoration: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial; color: rgb(0, 129, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word;\" target=\"_blank\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">加密货币</font></font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">交易者和投资者利用这些策略来应对数字资产的高度波动性和投机性，并在看涨和看跌的市场条件下抓住机会。</font></font></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps