iv class=\"iirgi4a\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial; position: relative; height: 450px; width: 754.034px; overflow: hidden;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><img _mstalt=\"574444\" _msthash=\"129\" alt=\"cover image of news article\" class=\"cr8g41v\" data-nimg=\"fill\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" src=\"https://cimg.cnyes.cool/prod/news/6350453/l/2cb816c21928c74f7cca43d8d5f77683.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: inline; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 6px; color: transparent; max-width: 100%; width: 754.034px; position: absolute; height: 450px; inset: 0px;\"></span></div>\n<figcaption _msthash=\"130\" _msttexthash=\"309384062\" class=\"c1gcnfq1\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; color: rgb(144, 144, 144); max-width: 100%; width: 650px; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">火马年宜行稳致远 富达投信看好主动式策略与多元配置抗波动。</span></figcaption></figure></div>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p _msthash=\"131\" _msttexthash=\"4728691253\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">时序进入火马年，全球投资环境呈现节奏快且变化强的特点。 川普政策动向影响产业供应链调整，加上美伊冲突等地缘政治风险，市场不确定性维持高档。 富达投信投资长陈威宏分析，今年市场呈现万马奔腾但方向不一的态势，投资人应舍弃追求速度的思维，转而透过基本面分析与纪律，建立多元分散配置的韧性，以稳健步伐达成投资目标。</span></p>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p _msthash=\"133\" _msttexthash=\"3935932286\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">在总体经济方面，全球动能虽放缓但整体仍具支撑，区域分化则愈趋明显。 美国就业市场稳定，经济表现相对强劲，市场预期美联储降息时点可能由6月延后至7月，若景气走弱，政府预计将采取积极货币政策。 此外，AI人工智能投资持续推动企业资本支出，影响力已从大型企业扩散至各产业板块，支撑市场风险偏好。</span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p _msthash=\"134\" _msttexthash=\"5047381404\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">欧洲市场受惠于企业财报表现及资金分散需求，欧股 Stoxx 600 指数近期创下历史新高。 虽然今年整体增长预期较为温和，但通胀下行有利于政策转向。 亚洲部分，日本在稳定框架下推动改革，企业信心提升并积极参与海外投资; 新兴亚洲受惠成长动能回温与中期美元走弱，具备评价面优势。 中国则以稳为主，政策支持与出口韧性展现利多，惟内需修复仍需时间。</span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p _msthash=\"135\" _msttexthash=\"2750780799\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">针对后市配置，陈威宏强调在供应链重组常态化下，应采取多元分散的主动式策略。 股票投资应审慎选股，聚焦具备成长性、财务稳健且有股息增长潜力的大型企业，并可运用选择权等衍生工具增加收益与防御力。 除美、欧市场外，日本与中国亦是具潜力的观察重点。</span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p _msthash=\"136\" _msttexthash=\"1827703605\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">债券市场方面，在降息趋势与高利环境并存下，投资人可掌握收益与风险控制的双重契机。 目前投资等级债利差偏窄，相对看好优质的非投资等级债与新兴市场债。 政府公债虽面临财政压力，但仍具备分散风险效果。</span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p _msthash=\"137\" _msttexthash=\"1810097237\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">陈威宏建议，透过专业团队动态调整股债比例的多元资产产品，能有效因应市场轮动。 投资人应聚焦企业竞争力与现金流，维持耐心与纪律，并定期进行组合再平衡，以在马拉松式的投资旅程中稳健抵达终点。</span></p></section></section></body></html>',0,26,'','2026-06-18 11:54:00','2026-06-22 16:56:49'),(2269,62,NULL,'奶粉罐里藏黄金寄出？一场“投资”差点让她血本无归','','','',NULL,NULL,'','“奶粉罐里可以藏黄金吗？”“邮寄黄金怎么保价？”“寄违规快递会怎样？”——这一连串看似离奇的搜索记录，成了一起投资骗局的关键突破','https://www.chiefrich.com/d/file/p/6e71b9db4a4609338f5479739cef6280.png','<html><head></head><body><p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">“奶粉罐里可以藏黄金吗？”“邮寄黄金怎么保价？”“寄违规快递会怎样？”——这一连串看似离奇的搜索记录，成了一起投资骗局的关键突破口。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">近日，浙江宁波市的一名女子在陌生网友的“指导”下，下载虚假投资软件，投入小额资金尝到甜头后，竟将80克黄金塞进奶粉罐，试图通过快递寄往指定地址“置换利润”。所幸警方及时拦截，黄金被成功追回。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">8万元“买礼物”？搜索记录露马脚</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">事发当日，宁波警方接到反诈预警，辖区内范女士已产生多笔大额支出，极有可能正在遭遇诈骗。但当民警登门劝阻时，范女士语气镇定，坚称这几万元全是用作给家人购置礼物，对其他细节三缄其口。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">然而，民警敏锐地捕捉到她的神情紧绷、语速异常，征得同意后查看手机，赫然发现：浏览历史里，充斥着“金条保价”“奶粉罐藏金”“顺丰寄金条”等关键词。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">一边说是买礼物，一边却在查如何邮寄黄金——这显然不是普通消费。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"奶粉罐里藏黄金寄出？一场“投资”差点让她血本无归\" data-height=\"383px\" data-viewer=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2026/02/12/105429864.png\" data-width=\"426px\" src=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2026/02/12/105429864.png\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer; text-align: center; max-width: 95%;\" title=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">骗子手把手教学：如何把黄金藏进奶粉罐邮寄</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">面对这些无法自圆其说的搜索记录，范女士终于松口。她下载了一款所谓的“投资返利”App，起初投入少量资金，很快收到高额“返利”。随后“客服”称，想继续获得更高回报，必须购买黄金实物寄到指定地址，用于“置换利润”。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">为了让这批黄金顺利通过快递关卡，对方甚至发来图文教程：把金条塞进奶粉罐，再填充奶粉压紧，即可“正常发货”。<span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; text-indent: 2em;\">就这样，范女士购买了80克黄金，如法炮制，将奶粉罐寄了出去。</span></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">得知黄金已经离手，民警立即协调快递公司全网排查。最终，在物流中转站的成堆快件中，那只塞满黄金的奶粉罐被成功拦截。黄金如数追回，范女士的损失在最后一刻被拦了下来。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"奶粉罐里藏黄金寄出？一场“投资”差点让她血本无归\" data-height=\"335px\" data-viewer=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2026/02/12/105444723.png\" data-width=\"458px\" src=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2026/02/12/105444723.png\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer; text-align: center; max-width: 95%;\" title=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">这不是投资，是洗钱，是诈骗</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">这套话术并不新鲜，但包装越来越精致。用“黄金通道”绕过银行转账的风控，用“实物置换”把骗局包装成内部渠道，再用小额返利彻底打消受害者的疑虑——等对方收到黄金的那一刻，所谓的“平台客服”便会连同本金一起人间蒸发。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">更值得警惕的是，这类骗局近来有抬头之势。诈骗团伙不再满足于直接转账汇款，而是诱导受害者购买黄金、虚拟币甚至奢侈品，再通过快递、上门取件等方式完成资产转移。一方面规避了账户冻结的风险，另一方面也让受害者“钱货两清”，追查难度更大。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">要避坑此类骗局其实足够简单，只需记住：凡是以“投资”“担保”“充值”为名，要求购买黄金、珠宝、虚拟货币并邮寄或交付给第三方的，无一例外，都是诈骗。不论对方出示多正规的资质截图，不论App界面多像大牌券商，不论前期返利多快、提现多顺，只要涉及“寄黄金”，请立刻止损！</p></body></html>',0,54,'','2026-06-18 11:54:01','2026-06-22 16:56:40'),(2270,62,NULL,'黄金投资骗局盯上退休族 这六个信号就是陷阱标记','','','',NULL,NULL,'','黄金本身并非陷阱，陷阱在于销售者的手段。退休人士在将养老积蓄投入贵金属之前，务必咨询独立于交易商的理财顾问，独立核实金价，全面调查公司背景。切勿因焦虑仓促下单。请记住：越是听起来“稳赚不赔”“千载难逢”的机会，越可能是精心伪装的骗局。','https://www.chiefrich.com/d/file/p/ff394e93d393dadc947f73b73a503caf.png','<html><head></head><body><p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">通胀高企、市场震荡、经济前景不明，越来越多退休人士面临购买力缩水的压力。在这一背景下，实物黄金被包装成“避险之王”频频进入老年投资者的视野。黄金有形、保值，看似稳妥，加之“为资产上保险”的话术，极易打动依赖积蓄生活的长者。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">然而，每当经济情绪低迷，黄金骗局便随之抬头。许多骗局披着专业理财的外衣，话术严谨、语气紧迫，甚至打出“专为长者定制”的旗号。看似寻常的理财咨询，实则是一步步收紧的高压推销，目标直指老年人的养老积蓄。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"黄金投资骗局盯上退休族 这六个信号就是陷阱标记\" data-height=\"450px\" data-viewer=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2026/02/13/110706803.png\" data-width=\"800px\" height=\"338\" src=\"https://img.dgrhw.net/upload/images/master/2026/02/13/110706803.png\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial; cursor: pointer; text-align: center; max-width: 95%;\" title=\"\" width=\"600\"></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">识破这些骗局的关键，在于看懂其背后的操作套路。以下六大预警信号，退休人士在掏钱前务必看清：</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">一、“老年理财专员”主动找上门</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">若你接到陌生来电、邮件或信件，对方自称专为长者提供黄金理财建议，应立刻警觉。正规贵金属商极少主动联系个人投资者，更不会打着“老年专属”旗号推销。任何以“政府即将没收退休账户”“美元即将崩盘”为由头的紧急警告，基本都是骗局开场白。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">二、制造紧迫感，施压快速成交</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">“优惠今日截止”“限量供应”是惯用伎俩。正规商家不会催促客户仓促拍板。若对方拒绝提供书面资料、劝你不要咨询家人或理财顾问，甚至因你需要考虑时间而表露不满，即属危险信号。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">三、宣称“稳赚不赔”“零风险”</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">黄金价格随市涨跌，并无保本机制。任何承诺“只涨不跌”“绝对安全”“抵御一切经济风险”的说法，都违背基本投资规律。若销售人员让你相信黄金是眼下“唯一可投的避风港”，那多半是在编织幻象。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">四、溢价离谱、费用含糊</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">骗局常见手法之一，是以高于市场价50%至100%的价格兜售金币、金条。老年人若不查实时金价，极易上当。购买前务必通过独立渠道核价；若对方不愿明示加价幅度或隐藏费用，应直接止步。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">五、施压套现退休账户</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">诈骗者常怂恿老人提取IRA、401(k)等退休账户资金，并“热心协助”办理转仓。即便合法黄金IRA确有其事，不法分子也会借机制造提前取款罚金及税负，再叠加虚高售价，令受害者双重受损。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">六、资质不明、回避监管</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">正规贵金属交易商均须在当地监管机构注册。如对方拒绝提供可核实的注册信息、无实体办公地址，或以“黄金特殊”为由声称不需遵循常规监管，即属明显异常。市面上合法经销商众多，错过一家并非损失。</p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif, 宋体, Arial;\">结语</strong></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-style: normal; margin: 15px 0px 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;宋体,PingFang SC,Lantinghei SC,Helvetica Neue&quot;; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 30px; font-size: 16px; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">黄金本身并非陷阱，陷阱在于销售者的手段。退休人士在将养老积蓄投入贵金属之前，务必咨询独立于交易商的理财顾问，独立核实金价，全面调查公司背景。切勿因焦虑仓促下单。请记住：越是听起来“稳赚不赔”“千载难逢”的机会，越可能是精心伪装的骗局。</p></body></html>',0,20,'','2026-06-18 11:54:03','2026-06-22 16:56:31'),(2271,62,NULL,'美期中选举倒数基金专家：2026多元配置稳中求胜','','','',NULL,NULL,'','美国期中选举Big MAC 进入倒数，将于今(2026) 年11 月起跑，川普政府为巩固民调全力冲刺经济，推动「大而美法案」(OBBBA) 减税措施箭在弦上，所带来红利包括提高标准扣除额、增加儿童抵免、新增老年人扣除额6,000 美元，以及小费、加班费与汽车贷款利息免税等，预估退税金额逾千亿美元，为美国消费动能再添柴火。<br />\n<br />\n','https://www.chiefrich.com/d/file/p/41caae744cf7b10e5159528b43d40360.png','<html><head></head><body><section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">美国期中选举Big MAC 进入倒数，将于今(2026) 年11 月起跑，川普政府为巩固民调全力冲刺经济，推动「大而美法案」(OBBBA) 减税措施箭在弦上，所带来红利包括提高标准扣除额、增加儿童抵免、新增老年人扣除额6,000 美元，以及小费、加班费与汽车贷款利息免税等，预估退税金额逾千亿美元，为美国消费动能再添柴火。</font></font></span></p></section>\n<div class=\"c1hvmcli\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px 24px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial; width: 802px;\">\n<figure style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"iirgi4a\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial; position: relative; height: 450px; width: 754px; overflow: hidden;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><img alt=\"cover image of news article\" class=\"cr8g41v\" data-nimg=\"fill\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" src=\"https://cimg.cnyes.cool/prod/news/6345396/l/ebe765e60dab41c99eeb8d5b9dd4e1d3.jpg\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: inline; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 6px; color: transparent; max-width: 100%; width: 754px; position: absolute; height: 450px; inset: 0px;\"></span></div>\n<figcaption class=\"c1gcnfq1\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; color: rgb(144, 144, 144); max-width: 100%; width: 650px; text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">美期中选举倒数，基金专家:2026多元配置稳中求胜。&nbsp;</font></font></span></figcaption></figure></div>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">与此同时，川普正式提名前联准会理事华许（Kevin Warsh）接任5 月即将卸任的鲍尔，出任下届联准会主席，市场将其评论为「披着鸽皮的鹰」，为2026 年货币政策走向埋下变数。</font></font></span></p>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">回顾2025 年，科技巨头倾全力投入AI 资本支出，驱动美股科技类股强势领涨；台湾供应链同步搭上AI 顺风车，半导体与伺服器产业扩张动能强劲，带动台湾加权报酬指数(含息) 全年飙升29.47%。值得关注的是，即便股市行情火热，地缘政治与市场波动仍促使避险资金卡位</font></font><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/XAUUSDOZ\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; text-decoration: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial; color: rgb(0, 129, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">黄金</font></font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">，金价2025 全年大涨约64%，涨幅惊人。</font></font></span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">尽管行情看涨，但在利率政策走向未明、地缘政治风险犹存的环境下，投资人显然更倾向「收益优先、波动可控」的多资产配置策略，而非重压单一市场，根据基金观测站统计，境外基金2025 全年净申购前10 名中，固定收益型与平衡型基金占了8 档，股票型基金仅2 档。</font></font></span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">中租基金平台总经理苏皓毅表示，2026 年仍持续看好风险性资产的表现，但在投资策略方面，建议投资人采取多元配置。在AI 投资领域，应分散布局半导体、云端服务与电力基础设施三大面向；区域配置上，除国人熟悉的美、台、日股之外，也可适度提高全球避险热钱偏好的成熟国家如新加坡股市，或是搭配新兴市场如越南的投资比重。</font></font></span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">基金专家也同时提醒投资人，股市仍有震荡修正空间，可把握股市回档时机，落实纪律扣款策略，分批进场降低风险。</font></font></span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">债券配置方面，则建议视个人风险承受能力，适度配置中短天期的非投资等级债，或布局新兴市场美元债，以参与新兴市场经济复苏机会，另一方面也可在美元走弱时受惠新兴市场货币的汇兑收益。</font></font></span></p></section></section></body></html>',0,100,'','2026-06-18 11:54:04','2026-06-22 19:58:41'),(2272,62,NULL,'对冲基金买进亚股规模创10年新高作多力道8.4倍碾压空单','','','',NULL,NULL,'','受惠于市场对AI 基础设施产业的强劲乐观情绪，新兴与发达亚洲市场上周涌现极大规模的资金挹注。根据高盛主经纪商业务（Prime Services）交易台的观测数据，上周避险基金对该区域的净买超幅度，创下该行自2016 年启动数据追踪以来的历史新高。','https://www.chiefrich.com/d/file/p/deb91e862e9490cd3d062eaf193f19fe.png','<html><head></head><body><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">受惠于市场对AI 基础设施产业的强劲乐观情绪，新兴与发达亚洲市场上周涌现极大规模的资金挹注。根据高盛主经纪商业务（Prime Services）交易台的观测数据，上周避险基金对该区域的净买超幅度，创下该行自2016 年启动数据追踪以来的历史新高。</span></span>\n<div class=\"c1hvmcli\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px 24px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial; width: 802px;\">\n<figure style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"iirgi4a\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial; position: relative; height: 450px; width: 754px; overflow: hidden;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><img alt=\"cover image of news article\" class=\"cr8g41v\" data-nimg=\"fill\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" src=\"https://cimg.cnyes.cool/prod/news/6345934/l/795c0347d21995