ing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">高盛报告中指出，对冲基金上周转为净买入全球股票，为三周来首见，资金流入所有主要市场，但亚洲表现最为突出。随着投资人自动能型交易转向，新兴市场持续跑赢大盘，同时也反映美元走弱的影响。</font></font></span></p>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">MSCI 新兴市场指数今年以来上涨11%，南韩Kospi 指数则大涨逾30%，主要受三星电子与SK 海力士等大型制造业企业带动。相较之下，截至上周五(13 日) 收盘，</font></font><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/INX\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; text-decoration: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial; color: rgb(0, 129, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">标普500 指数</font></font></a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">下跌0.1%。</font></font></span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">高盛交易部门在致客户报告中指出，上周亚洲市场的交易活动主要由做多买盘带动，其买入规模与放空平仓的比例高达8.4 比1，显示法人机构对该区域后市持有高度信心。</font></font></span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">就全球产业而言，该交易部门表示，资讯科技、工业、民生必需品与原物料类股的买盘，均超过其他板块的卖压；而非必需消费品、通讯服务与金融类股则遭到最为明显的抛售。</font></font></span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot;Pingfang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft Jhenghei&quot;, Arial, VideoJS, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: initial; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;\">此外，对冲基金连续第三周卖出美国房地产类股，且抛售速度为2022 年9 月以来最快，主要由多头减码与放空操作所驱动。</font></font></span></p></section>\n<section style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 300; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;, &quot